1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,283
这是一台云上的全新电脑
Here's a brand-new computer in the cloud.

2
00:00:02,603 --> 00:00:05,803
它是我们的，有 root 权限，也就是完整的管理员权限
It's ours, and we have root, full administrator rights.

3
00:00:06,123 --> 00:00:09,600
我们让 pip 装两个 Python 包，pip 说不行
We ask pip for two Python packages, and pip says no.

4
00:00:10,083 --> 00:00:14,648
这条命令不是 README 里的，是我们大多数人最先会敲的那条
This command isn't from the README; it's the one most of us would type first.

5
00:00:14,968 --> 00:00:18,373
报错说这个环境是 externally managed（由外部管理）
The error says the environment is externally managed,

6
00:00:18,373 --> 00:00:20,622
还建议用虚拟环境
and suggests a virtual environment.

7
00:00:20,942 --> 00:00:24,163
看完这个视频，报错的每一行你都会看懂
By the end of this video, every line of it will make sense.

8
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:28,015
今天这节课，“虚拟”这个词会出现两次
Today's lecture uses the word virtual twice.

9
00:00:28,335 --> 00:00:32,132
虚拟机，就是一整台你租来、用完就扔的电脑
A virtual machine is a whole computer you rent and throw away.

10
00:00:32,452 --> 00:00:37,529
虚拟环境，就是给一个项目专用的一套 Python 包
A virtual environment is a private set of Python packages for one project.

11
00:00:37,849 --> 00:00:39,727
而且，一个会装在另一个里面
And one will live inside the other.

12
00:00:39,967 --> 00:00:42,531
这个教程叫 simple-translate
The tutorial, simple-translate, runs one small app four ways, each removing a kind of fragility.

13
00:00:42,531 --> 00:00:46,708
它用四种方式跑同一个小应用，每一种都去掉一类隐患
The tutorial, simple-translate, runs one small app four ways, each removing a kind of fragility.

14
00:00:47,028 --> 00:00:49,713
今天我们爬前两级
Today we climb the first two rungs:

15
00:00:49,713 --> 00:00:55,391
先在云端 VM 上手动安装，再换一台同样配置的全新 VM，改用 uv
a manual install on a cloud VM, then a fresh VM of the same kind, with uv.

16
00:00:55,711 --> 00:00:57,439
Docker 留到下节课
Docker comes next lecture.

17
00:00:57,683 --> 00:01:00,926
想跟着做的话，把 README 打开，放在视频旁边
To follow along, open the README beside this video.

18
00:01:01,246 --> 00:01:03,976
左上角的进度条显示 README 的步骤
The tracker, top left, shows the README step.

19
00:01:04,296 --> 00:01:06,814
代码面板会标出文件和行号
Code panels show the file and line numbers.

20
00:01:07,134 --> 00:01:09,494
看到黄色的“轮到你了”标签，就暂停
When the yellow your-turn tag appears,

21
00:01:09,494 --> 00:01:12,040
在你自己的 VM 上跑这条命令
pause and run the command on your own VM.

22
00:01:12,360 --> 00:01:16,181
灰色的“额外”标签表示这条命令 README 里没有
A grey extra tag marks a command that isn't in the README;

23
00:01:16,181 --> 00:01:18,355
额外的命令都是安全的，也一起跑吧
extras are safe, so run them too.

24
00:01:18,675 --> 00:01:23,326
每条命令也都在学习指南里，在 MLOps Learning 这个 repo 里
Every command is also in the study guide, in the MLOps Learning repo.

25
00:01:23,567 --> 00:01:25,880
开始前先做完 Tutorial 0
Before you start, finish Tutorial 0,

26
00:01:25,880 --> 00:01:29,156
这样你就有一个 Google Cloud 项目，结算也开好了
so you have a Google Cloud project with billing on.

27
00:01:29,476 --> 00:01:33,380
今天不用服务账号，也不用密钥，有个浏览器就行
No service account or keys today; all you need is a browser.

28
00:01:34,417 --> 00:01:37,596
装东西之前，先看看要装的是什么
Before we install anything, let's see what we're installing.

29
00:01:37,916 --> 00:01:42,481
在 GitHub 上打开 cli.py，待会儿你会把它 clone 到 VM 上
Open cli.py on GitHub; you'll clone it onto your VM soon.

30
00:01:42,801 --> 00:01:47,068
前两个 import，argparse 和 asyncio，是 Python 自带的
The first two imports, argparse and asyncio, come with Python.

31
00:01:47,388 --> 00:01:50,033
后两个，art 和 googletrans，就不是了
The next two, art and googletrans, don't.

32
00:01:50,353 --> 00:01:51,953
它们总得从某个地方来
They have to come from somewhere.

33
00:01:52,273 --> 00:01:55,004
这整节课，讲的就是它们从哪儿来
This whole lecture is about where they come from.

34
00:01:55,250 --> 00:01:59,695
这个 main 函数先打印一个横幅，用 ASCII 字符画写着 AC215
The main function prints a banner that says AC215 in ASCII art,

35
00:01:59,695 --> 00:02:03,506
然后是解析好的参数，最后是要翻译的文本
then the parsed arguments, then the text to translate.

36
00:02:03,826 --> 00:02:08,008
如果用 -f 传一个文件，文本就改从那个文件里读
If you pass a file with -f, the text comes from that file instead.

37
00:02:08,250 --> 00:02:13,316
最下面，argparse 定义了四个选项，各有默认值
At the bottom, argparse defines four options, and each one has a default:

38
00:02:13,316 --> 00:02:18,106
文本是 I love cheese，源语言是英语，目标语言是意大利语
the text I love cheese, source language English, destination Italian.

39
00:02:18,426 --> 00:02:21,242
所以不带任何选项运行 cli.py
So running cli.py with no options

40
00:02:21,242 --> 00:02:24,485
就会把 I love cheese 翻译成意大利语
translates I love cheese into Italian.

41
00:02:24,734 --> 00:02:27,980
最后一行启动事件循环并运行 main
The last line starts an event loop and runs main,

42
00:02:27,980 --> 00:02:31,027
因为 googletrans 4 是异步的
because googletrans version 4 is asynchronous.

43
00:02:31,347 --> 00:02:34,356
在 main 里，一个 Translator 把你的文本发出去
Inside main, a Translator sends your text off

44
00:02:34,356 --> 00:02:35,956
只用一次 await 调用
with one awaited call.

45
00:02:36,067 --> 00:02:39,531
这次调用就是一个 HTTPS 请求
That call is a single HTTPS request

46
00:02:39,531 --> 00:02:43,491
从 VM 发到 translate.googleapis.com
from the VM to translate.googleapis.com.

47
00:02:43,811 --> 00:02:47,350
这是 Google 非官方的翻译接口
It's Google's unofficial translate endpoint:

48
00:02:47,350 --> 00:02:49,763
免费，不用 API key，也不做任何保证
free, no API key, no promises.

49
00:02:50,083 --> 00:02:54,584
返回来一小段 JSON，第 39 行把译文打印出来
A little JSON comes back, and line 39 prints the translation.

50
00:02:54,834 --> 00:02:59,869
第 25 行有个细节以后会用到：raise_exception=True
One detail on line 25 matters later: raise_exception=True.

51
00:03:00,189 --> 00:03:03,041
没有它的话，Google 一旦返回错误
Without it, when Google answers with an error,

52
00:03:03,041 --> 00:03:06,141
googletrans 就把错误藏起来
googletrans hides it and hands your own input back

53
00:03:06,141 --> 00:03:08,807
把你的原文当成译文交回来，看上去一切正常
as the translation, so nothing looks wrong.

54
00:03:09,127 --> 00:03:11,986
有了它，失败就会变成一条你能看懂的报错
With it, a failure becomes an error you can read.

55
00:03:12,234 --> 00:03:15,424
第 32 到 37 行会接住那次调用的任何错误
Lines 32 to 37 catch any error from that call

56
00:03:15,424 --> 00:03:19,253
再包装成一条更友好的消息，说是网络的问题
and wrap it in a friendlier message about the network.

57
00:03:19,573 --> 00:03:21,165
记住这几行
Remember these lines.

58
00:03:21,215 --> 00:03:23,092
几分钟后，它们就会误导我们
In a few minutes, they'll fool us.

59
00:03:23,400 --> 00:03:27,837
所以这个应用很小：参数进去，一次网络请求，一行输出
So the app is small: arguments in, one web request, one line out.

60
00:03:28,157 --> 00:03:30,781
它需要的，是两个第三方包
What it needs is two third-party packages.

61
00:03:31,101 --> 00:03:33,576
我们去弄一台电脑，给它们安个家
Let's get a computer, and find them a home.

62
00:03:34,817 --> 00:03:37,784
虚拟机就是一台真实服务器切出来的一片
A virtual machine is a slice of a real server

63
00:03:37,784 --> 00:03:39,894
在 Google 的某个数据中心里
in one of Google's data centers.

64
00:03:40,214 --> 00:03:42,441
有一种软件叫 hypervisor（虚拟机监控器）
Software called a hypervisor

65
00:03:42,441 --> 00:03:44,225
它把这台机器切成一片一片
carves the machine into slices.

66
00:03:44,545 --> 00:03:48,310
每一片都从这台服务器分到虚拟 CPU 和内存
Each slice gets virtual CPUs and memory from that server,

67
00:03:48,310 --> 00:03:52,737
从 Google 的存储网络分到一块磁盘，还有自己的操作系统
a disk from Google's storage network, and its own operating system.

68
00:03:53,057 --> 00:03:54,657
其中一片会是你的
One of them will be yours.

69
00:03:54,884 --> 00:03:59,719
在控制台里，先确认选中的是你在 Tutorial 0 建的项目
In the console, check that your Tutorial 0 project is selected,

70
00:03:59,719 --> 00:04:03,097
然后打开 Compute Engine，再进 VM instances
then open Compute Engine, then VM instances.

71
00:04:03,417 --> 00:04:07,666
第一次进去，它可能会让你启用 Compute Engine API
The first time, it may ask you to enable the Compute Engine API;

72
00:04:07,666 --> 00:04:09,924
点 Enable，再等它一分钟
click enable and give it a minute.

73
00:04:10,244 --> 00:04:11,844
然后点 Create instance
Then click Create instance.

74
00:04:12,084 --> 00:04:15,455
README 没给任何设置，这里给一套合理的选择
The README gives no settings, so here are sensible ones.

75
00:04:15,775 --> 00:04:18,676
名称，比如 ac215-l01
A name, like ac215-l01.

76
00:04:18,996 --> 00:04:22,196
区域和可用区，就是这台机器实际放在哪里
A region and zone: where the machine physically lives.

77
00:04:22,516 --> 00:04:27,465
机器类型决定 CPU 和内存，e2-small 就够用了
A machine type, which sets the CPUs and memory; e2-small is plenty.

78
00:04:27,785 --> 00:04:29,897
启动磁盘选 Debian 12
And a boot disk with Debian 12.

79
00:04:30,217 --> 00:04:33,801
用 Debian 13 也行，后面会看到它在哪些地方不一样
Debian 13 works too; we'll see where it changes things.

80
00:04:34,050 --> 00:04:37,378
保留外部 IP（也就是公网 IP），它默认就是开着的
Keep the external IP address; it's on by default.

81
00:04:37,698 --> 00:04:40,464
没有它，又没做额外的网络配置
Without it, and without extra network setup,

82
00:04:40,464 --> 00:04:44,802
这台 VM 就上不了网，这里的每次下载都会卡住
this VM can't reach the internet, and every download here would hang.

83
00:04:45,050 --> 00:04:46,650
现在，计价器开始跳了
And now the meter starts.

84
00:04:46,927 --> 00:04:52,858
CPU 和内存在 VM 运行期间按秒计费，闲着也照样算
CPU and memory are billed by the second while the VM runs, even when it sits idle.

85
00:04:53,178 --> 00:04:55,631
磁盘只要还在，就一直计费
The disk is billed for as long as it exists.

86
00:04:55,951 --> 00:04:59,578
费用估算不高，但计价器自己不会停
The estimate is small, but the meter never stops on its own.

87
00:04:59,834 --> 00:05:03,418
点 Create，等绿勾出现，再点 SSH
Click Create, wait for the green check, then click SSH.

88
00:05:03,738 --> 00:05:07,215
要是让你授权这次连接，就点 Authorize
If it asks you to authorize the connection, click Authorize.

89
00:05:07,535 --> 00:05:11,375
浏览器里会打开一个终端，已经登录到新 VM 上
A terminal opens in your browser, logged in to your new VM.

90
00:05:11,695 --> 00:05:14,981
我们的提示符显示 student，你的是你自己的用户名
Our prompt says student; yours shows your own username.

91
00:05:15,301 --> 00:05:17,796
先在这里暂停，把你的 VM 也弄到这一步
Pause here, and get your VM to this point.

92
00:05:18,050 --> 00:05:20,823
来做三个快速的额外检查，README 里都没有
Three quick extra checks, not in the README.

93
00:05:21,143 --> 00:05:23,789
第一，我们拿到的是哪个操作系统？
First, which operating system did we get?

94
00:05:24,109 --> 00:05:28,120
打印 os-release 文件：Debian 12，代号 bookworm
Print the os-release file: Debian 12, nicknamed bookworm.

95
00:05:28,384 --> 00:05:30,987
第二，再问一下 python3 的版本
Second, ask python3 for its version.

96
00:05:31,307 --> 00:05:36,960
Debian 12 自带 Python 3.11.2，给操作系统自己用
Debian 12 ships Python 3.11.2, for the operating system itself.

97
00:05:37,280 --> 00:05:40,992
换成 Debian 13，你会看到 3.13.5
On Debian 13, you'd see 3.13.5.

98
00:05:41,312 --> 00:05:42,976
这两个数字都记住
Keep both numbers in mind.

99
00:05:43,234 --> 00:05:45,623
第三，which python，不带 3
Third, which python, without the 3.

100
00:05:45,943 --> 00:05:48,930
这个 which 命令，查一个名字会运行哪个程序
The which command asks which program a name would run.

101
00:05:49,250 --> 00:05:53,943
查 python，什么都没返回：Debian 有 python3，但没有 python
For python, nothing comes back: Debian has python3, but no python.

102
00:05:54,263 --> 00:05:55,970
记住它，第二部分要用
Remember this for part 2.

103
00:05:57,033 --> 00:05:59,550
第 3 步：输入 sudo apt-get update
Step 3: type sudo apt-get update.

104
00:05:59,870 --> 00:06:04,436
Debian 的包管理器是 apt，sudo 让它以管理员身份运行
Debian's package manager is apt, and sudo runs it as the administrator.

105
00:06:04,756 --> 00:06:07,100
而 update 会下载软件包列表
Update downloads the package catalog:

106
00:06:07,100 --> 00:06:10,836
有哪些软件包，各自最新的版本是什么
the list of packages that exist, and their latest versions.

107
00:06:11,156 --> 00:06:12,820
这时还什么都没装
Nothing is installed yet.

108
00:06:13,140 --> 00:06:15,944
在 Google 的 VM 上，你会看到多出几行
On a Google VM, you'll see a few more lines,

109
00:06:15,944 --> 00:06:18,046
那是 Google 自己的软件源
for Google's own package sources.

110
00:06:18,366 --> 00:06:19,716
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

111
00:06:19,766 --> 00:06:23,670
这里 README 有个提示：apt-get 和 apt 做的是同一件事
The README has a tip here: apt-get and apt do the same job.

112
00:06:23,990 --> 00:06:27,325
其中 apt-get 这条命令稳定、适合写进脚本
The apt-get command is the stable, scriptable one,

113
00:06:27,325 --> 00:06:29,793
用在 Dockerfile 和自动化构建里
for Dockerfiles and automated builds.

114
00:06:30,113 --> 00:06:33,035
短一点的 apt，手敲起来更友好
The shorter apt is friendlier for typing by hand.

115
00:06:33,355 --> 00:06:34,866
这里用哪个都行
Either is fine here.

116
00:06:34,916 --> 00:06:37,305
第 4 步：sudo apt install git
Step 4: sudo apt install git.

117
00:06:37,625 --> 00:06:39,844
这次 apt 是真的要装东西了
This time apt really installs things.

118
00:06:40,164 --> 00:06:43,556
它会列出要添加的东西，然后问你：要继续吗？
It lists what it will add and asks, do you want to continue?

119
00:06:43,876 --> 00:06:45,476
输入 Y，按回车
Type Y and press enter.

120
00:06:45,775 --> 00:06:50,020
列表因 VM 而异；如果已经有 git，apt 会直接告诉你
The list depends on your VM; if git is already there, apt says so.

121
00:06:50,340 --> 00:06:51,683
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

122
00:06:51,733 --> 00:06:53,610
第 5 步：把 repo clone 下来
Step 5: clone the repo.

123
00:06:53,930 --> 00:06:57,322
输入 git clone，再加上地址；地址从 README 里复制
Type git clone, then the address; copy it from the README.

124
00:06:57,642 --> 00:06:59,398
它会把整个 repo 连同历史
Git copies the whole repo,

125
00:06:59,398 --> 00:07:03,044
复制到一个新目录 simple-translate 里
with its history, into a new folder, simple-translate,

126
00:07:03,044 --> 00:07:04,644
就在你的 home 目录下
in your home directory.

127
00:07:04,833 --> 00:07:07,244
第 6 步：cd simple-translate
Step 6: cd simple-translate.

128
00:07:07,564 --> 00:07:11,745
注意看提示符：冒号后面现在显示你所在的目录
Watch the prompt: after the colon, it now shows the folder you're in.

129
00:07:12,065 --> 00:07:14,604
这个波浪号代表你的 home 目录
The wavy tilde means your home folder.

130
00:07:14,924 --> 00:07:16,630
暂停一下，跟上进度
Pause, and catch up to here.

131
00:07:16,866 --> 00:07:19,575
额外检查一下：用 ls 列出文件
One extra check: ls lists the files.

132
00:07:19,895 --> 00:07:21,395
里面有 cli.py、README
There's cli.py,

133
00:07:21,395 --> 00:07:24,510
一个存成文本文件的 Dockerfile
the README, a Dockerfile saved as a text file,

134
00:07:24,510 --> 00:07:28,217
两个下节课用的脚本，还有 pyproject.toml
two scripts for next lecture, and pyproject.toml,

135
00:07:28,217 --> 00:07:30,562
列着这个应用需要什么
the list of what the app needs.

136
00:07:30,882 --> 00:07:33,872
注意少了什么：没有 requirements 文件
Notice what's missing: no requirements file,

137
00:07:33,872 --> 00:07:36,386
也没有记录精确版本的 lock 文件
and no lock file with exact versions.

138
00:07:36,706 --> 00:07:38,306
先记住这一点
Hold on to that.

139
00:07:39,167 --> 00:07:42,324
第 7 步：sudo apt install python3-pip
Step 7: sudo apt install python3-pip.

140
00:07:42,644 --> 00:07:46,570
这是 Debian 自己打包的 pip，给 Debian 的 Python 用
That's Debian's own packaged copy of pip, for Debian's Python.

141
00:07:46,890 --> 00:07:48,440
再输入一次 Y
Answer Y again.

142
00:07:48,490 --> 00:07:53,375
我们这次连带装了一百多个软件包；真正的 VM 上通常会少一些
Ours pulled in over a hundred packages; a real VM usually needs fewer.

143
00:07:53,695 --> 00:07:55,034
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

144
00:07:55,084 --> 00:07:58,135
额外检查一下：问问 pip3 的版本
An extra check: ask pip3 for its version.

145
00:07:58,455 --> 00:08:01,679
它是 pip 23.0.1，对应 Python 3.11
It's pip 23.0.1, for Python 3.11,

146
00:08:01,679 --> 00:08:06,369
在 /usr/lib 下面一个叫 dist-packages 的目录里
in a folder called dist-packages under /usr/lib.

147
00:08:06,689 --> 00:08:11,297
这个 user 拼作 usr：指的是系统的文件，不是你的 home 目录
That user is spelled usr: the system's files, not your home folder.

148
00:08:11,534 --> 00:08:15,939
现在跑视频开头那条命令，不带 sudo，也不带任何参数
Now the command from the start of the video, without sudo or any flag;

149
00:08:15,939 --> 00:08:17,827
它也不在 README 里
it isn't in the README either.

150
00:08:18,147 --> 00:08:22,371
还是一样，pip 拒绝了：这个环境是 externally managed
Again, pip refuses: this environment is externally managed.

151
00:08:22,691 --> 00:08:26,851
提示说：用 apt 安装，或者建一个虚拟环境
The hint says: install with apt, or create a virtual environment.

152
00:08:27,171 --> 00:08:29,966
它最后一句甚至给出了绕过去的办法
Its last note even names a way around it.

153
00:08:30,200 --> 00:08:31,537
为什么要拒绝？
Why refuse?

154
00:08:31,587 --> 00:08:33,805
先想想 Python 怎么找 import 的东西
Picture how Python finds an import.

155
00:08:34,125 --> 00:08:37,699
这条额外的一行命令打印 sys.path 这个列表
This extra one-liner prints the list called sys.path:

156
00:08:37,699 --> 00:08:39,587
也就是 Python 会搜索的那些目录
the folders Python searches.

157
00:08:39,907 --> 00:08:41,507
把它们想成一层层的架子
Think of them as shelves.

158
00:08:41,656 --> 00:08:46,755
每次 import，Python 都从最上面一层往下找，拿第一个对上的
On every import, Python scans from the top shelf down, and takes the first match.

159
00:08:47,967 --> 00:08:49,930
最下面这层是 apt 的
The bottom shelf belongs to apt.

160
00:08:50,250 --> 00:08:52,442
Debian 自己也在跑一些 Python 工具
Debian itself runs Python tools

161
00:08:52,442 --> 00:08:56,756
它们依赖的正是这些罐子，而且正是这些版本
that depend on exactly those jars, at exactly those versions.

162
00:08:57,076 --> 00:09:00,831
系统 Python 是一间公用厨房，掌勺的是 apt
The system Python is a shared kitchen, and apt is the cook.

163
00:09:01,151 --> 00:09:03,242
这就是 externally managed 的意思
That's what externally managed means.

164
00:09:03,562 --> 00:09:07,082
而 PEP 668 就是让 pip 遵守这一点的规则
PEP 668 is the rule that makes pip respect it.

165
00:09:07,317 --> 00:09:10,953
第 8 步是 README 里的命令：sudo pip3 install
Step 8 is the README's command: sudo pip3 install,

166
00:09:10,953 --> 00:09:13,717
加上 --break-system-packages 这个参数
with the flag --break-system-packages.

167
00:09:14,037 --> 00:09:18,453
这个参数绕过了保护；sudo 让 pip 以管理员身份写文件
The flag overrides the guard; sudo lets pip write as administrator.

168
00:09:18,773 --> 00:09:20,195
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

169
00:09:20,245 --> 00:09:22,693
我们要了 2 个包，装了 12 个
We asked for 2 packages and got 12;

170
00:09:22,693 --> 00:09:25,771
如果你看到 requirement already satisfied
if yours says requirement already satisfied,

171
00:09:25,771 --> 00:09:27,520
说明 apt 已经装过那个包了
apt already had that one.

172
00:09:27,840 --> 00:09:30,176
还有，警告说以 root 身份运行 pip
And the warning says running pip as root

173
00:09:30,176 --> 00:09:32,746
可能会和系统的包管理器冲突
can clash with the system's package manager.

174
00:09:32,984 --> 00:09:34,385
它们装到哪儿去了？
Where did they go?

175
00:09:34,435 --> 00:09:38,171
这条额外的一行命令问 googletrans 装在哪儿
This extra one-liner asks googletrans where it lives:

176
00:09:38,171 --> 00:09:40,568
在 /usr/local 下面的 dist-packages 里
in dist-packages under /usr/local,

177
00:09:40,568 --> 00:09:43,459
仍然是系统的，所有用户共用
still the system's, shared by every user.

178
00:09:43,779 --> 00:09:47,256
看看这些架子：这一层在 apt 那层的上面
Look at the shelves: that shelf sits above the one apt owns.

179
00:09:47,500 --> 00:09:52,556
现在假设，apt 之前为某个系统工具装过一个旧版的 httpx
Now suppose apt had installed an older httpx for some system tool.

180
00:09:52,876 --> 00:09:55,965
我们的 googletrans 需要 0.27.2 及以上
Our googletrans needs 0.27.2 or newer,

181
00:09:55,965 --> 00:10:00,193
所以 pip 会再装一份，放在更高的那层架子上
so pip would add a second copy, on the higher shelf.

182
00:10:00,513 --> 00:10:04,469
这时 Python 会先找到这一份，把 apt 那份挡住
Python would find that copy first and hide the one from apt,

183
00:10:04,469 --> 00:10:08,492
所有用系统 Python 的程序都这样，不只是我们的
for every program that uses the system Python, not just ours.

184
00:10:08,812 --> 00:10:10,412
这个参数破坏的，正是这一点
That's what the flag breaks.

185
00:10:10,567 --> 00:10:14,190
公平地说，README 里也讲了，这里是故意用这个参数
To be fair, the README says it uses the flag deliberately,

186
00:10:14,190 --> 00:10:18,439
当作快速演示，下一部分就会用正规的做法
as a quick demonstration, and the next walkthrough does it properly.

187
00:10:18,684 --> 00:10:20,284
来想一个问题
Something to ponder.

188
00:10:20,348 --> 00:10:26,526
这台 VM 上有个同学的项目，需要 httpx 0.13
A classmate's project on this VM needs httpx 0.13,

189
00:10:26,526 --> 00:10:29,863
而你的项目，需要的是 httpx 0.28
and yours needs httpx 0.28.

190
00:10:30,183 --> 00:10:32,423
两个项目都像这样，做系统级安装
Both install system-wide, like this.

191
00:10:32,743 --> 00:10:34,343
会怎么样？
What happens?

192
00:10:42,584 --> 00:10:46,808
架子只有一层，所以只放得下一个 httpx
There's only one shelf, so there's room for only one httpx.

193
00:10:47,128 --> 00:10:51,608
最后装的说了算，对所有人都一样，两个项目总有一个会坏
The last install wins, for everyone, and one of the two projects breaks.

194
00:10:53,150 --> 00:10:54,750
第 9 步：把它跑起来
Step 9: run it.

195
00:10:54,921 --> 00:11:00,809
输入 python3 cli.py，要带 3，因为这里没有不带 3 的 python
Type python3 cli.py, with the 3, since plain python doesn't exist here.

196
00:11:01,129 --> 00:11:05,359
你应该会看到横幅、参数、你的输入，还有输出
You should see the banner, the arguments, your input, and the output:

197
00:11:05,359 --> 00:11:06,959
意大利语版的 I love cheese
I love cheese, in Italian.

198
00:11:07,273 --> 00:11:10,734
要是出来一大段红色报错，什么都别改
If you get a long red error instead, don't change anything;

199
00:11:10,734 --> 00:11:12,905
待会儿我们一起读我们录到的那段
we'll read ours together in a minute.

200
00:11:13,225 --> 00:11:14,617
暂停一下，试试看
Pause and try it.

201
00:11:14,667 --> 00:11:16,608
然后跑 README 里的另外两条命令
Then the README's other two runs.

202
00:11:16,928 --> 00:11:22,112
其中 -t 指定文本，-s 指定源语言，-d 指定目标语言
-t gives the text, -s the source language, -d the destination.

203
00:11:22,432 --> 00:11:26,443
从 README 复制，连引号一起，暂停一下，两条都跑一遍
Copy them from the README, quotes included, and pause to run both.

204
00:11:26,763 --> 00:11:29,557
一条返回西班牙语，另一条返回法语
One comes back in Spanish, the other in French.

205
00:11:29,800 --> 00:11:34,252
说实话，我们录的时候，Google 拒绝了我们的请求
Now, honestly: when we recorded this, Google refused our requests,

206
00:11:34,252 --> 00:11:37,288
结果跑出来这一长串红色的 traceback
and the run ended in this long red traceback.

207
00:11:37,608 --> 00:11:40,915
我们来读一读，这种 traceback 整门课你都会碰到
Let's read it; you'll meet tracebacks like this all course long.

208
00:11:41,150 --> 00:11:43,625
这是一个链式 traceback：两个错误
This is a chained traceback: two errors.

209
00:11:43,945 --> 00:11:47,913
中间那一行说，第一个错误直接导致了第二个
The line between them says the first one directly caused the second.

210
00:11:48,233 --> 00:11:52,222
大多数人只看最后一行，可这里它只是外层包装
Most people read only the last line, but here that's just the wrapper.

211
00:11:52,542 --> 00:11:55,166
往上翻到第一个错误：那才是原因
Scroll up to the first error: that's the cause.

212
00:11:55,400 --> 00:11:59,539
原因是状态码 429，也就是请求太多
The cause is status code 429: too many requests.

213
00:11:59,859 --> 00:12:03,687
Google 的非官方接口在对我们的机器限流
Google's unofficial endpoint was rate-limiting our machine,

214
00:12:03,687 --> 00:12:06,088
对云上的机器，它经常这样
as it often does with cloud machines.

215
00:12:06,408 --> 00:12:09,478
这台 VM 上什么都没坏。最后一行的错误
Nothing on the VM was broken. The error

216
00:12:09,478 --> 00:12:15,488
是这个应用自己的外层包装，也就是 cli.py 的第 32 到 37 行
on the last line is the app's own wrapper, lines 32 to 37 of cli.py.

217
00:12:15,808 --> 00:12:20,566
它什么都接住，再抛出一条更友好的消息，接在原来的错误后面
It catches anything, and raises a friendlier message, chained to the original.

218
00:12:20,800 --> 00:12:22,400
为什么要看第一个错误？
Why read the first error?

219
00:12:22,592 --> 00:12:26,496
这条额外的命令故意打错了：xx 不是一种语言
This extra command has a typo: xx isn't a language.

220
00:12:26,816 --> 00:12:30,016
第一个错误说的是：目标语言无效
The first error says invalid destination language.

221
00:12:30,336 --> 00:12:35,435
但最后一行还是在怪网络，因为同一个外层包装什么都接
But the last line still blames the network, because the same wrapper catches everything.

222
00:12:35,755 --> 00:12:38,485
这是代码的小缺陷，不是你的配置有问题
A small flaw in the code, not in your setup.

223
00:12:38,805 --> 00:12:42,432
有效的语言代码，在 README 最下面的一张表里
The valid codes are in a table at the bottom of the README.

224
00:12:42,667 --> 00:12:45,329
如果你遇到 429，可以等一等再试
If you hit a 429, wait and retry,

225
00:12:45,329 --> 00:12:48,960
换个区域，或者在你的笔记本上跑
try another region, or run it on your laptop.

226
00:12:49,280 --> 00:12:53,430
只要走到了 Input 那一行，import 就都成功了
If you got as far as the Input line, the imports worked;

227
00:12:53,430 --> 00:12:57,579
第一个错误是 429 的话，说不行的只是网络
when the first error is a 429, only the network said no.

228
00:12:58,817 --> 00:13:01,654
第 10 步，也是最后一步：把 VM 删掉
Step 10, the last one: delete the VM.

229
00:13:01,974 --> 00:13:06,582
README 也说了，运行中的 VM 会一直计费，闲着也一样
As the README says, a running VM keeps charging, even when idle.

230
00:13:06,902 --> 00:13:09,313
那为什么要删除，而不只是停止？
So why delete it, and not just stop it?

231
00:13:09,550 --> 00:13:15,797
停止之后，CPU 和内存不再计费，但磁盘还在，所以还在计费
Stopping ends the billing for CPU and memory, but the disk still exists, so it keeps billing,

232
00:13:15,797 --> 00:13:18,148
预留的 IP 地址也一样
and so would a reserved IP address.

233
00:13:18,400 --> 00:13:23,029
删除会移除这台 VM，而且默认启动磁盘也一起删掉
Deleting removes the VM, and by default its boot disk goes with it.

234
00:13:23,349 --> 00:13:27,232
这是启动磁盘的一个设置，你没改过就是开着的
That's a setting on the boot disk, and it's on unless you changed it.

235
00:13:27,552 --> 00:13:29,152
计价器也就停了
And the meter stops.

236
00:13:29,237 --> 00:13:32,928
选中你的实例，点 Delete，暂停视频，等它删完
Select your instance, click Delete, and pause until it's gone.

237
00:13:33,167 --> 00:13:37,754
然后检查两个页面：VM instances 和 Disks 都应该是空的
Then check two pages: VM instances and Disks should both be empty.

238
00:13:38,074 --> 00:13:40,600
笔记本上装了 gcloud 命令行工具的话
With the gcloud tool on your laptop,

239
00:13:40,600 --> 00:13:44,950
两条额外的命令也能查：gcloud compute instances list
two extra commands do the same: gcloud compute instances list,

240
00:13:44,950 --> 00:13:47,055
还有 gcloud compute disks list
and gcloud compute disks list.

241
00:13:47,375 --> 00:13:49,103
这两条 README 里都没有
Neither is in the README.

242
00:13:49,350 --> 00:13:51,099
这就是简单粗暴的做法
That was the quick and dirty way.

243
00:13:51,419 --> 00:13:55,707
能用，但它改的是机器上每个程序都在用的系统 Python
It worked, but it changed the system Python for every program on the machine.

244
00:13:56,027 --> 00:13:59,846
第二部分：同一个应用，换台新 VM，用干净的做法
In part 2: the same app, on a fresh VM, the clean way.

245
00:14:01,083 --> 00:14:02,533
回到刚才那个问题
Back to our puzzle:

246
00:14:02,533 --> 00:14:06,651
两个项目，两个版本的 httpx，却只有一层公用的架子
two projects, two versions of httpx, one shared shelf.

247
00:14:06,971 --> 00:14:10,107
解决办法是给每个项目一个自己的工具箱
The fix is to give each project its own toolbox.

248
00:14:10,427 --> 00:14:12,966
这个工具箱，就是虚拟环境
That toolbox is a virtual environment.

249
00:14:13,200 --> 00:14:18,768
虚拟环境其实就是一个目录，名字通常是 .venv，分三个部分
A virtual environment is just a folder, usually called .venv, with three parts.

250
00:14:19,088 --> 00:14:21,776
第一，一个 bin 目录，里面有个 python
First, a bin folder with a python inside.

251
00:14:22,096 --> 00:14:26,746
它通常不是拷贝，只是个软链接，指向别处真正的解释器
It's usually not a copy, just a link to a real interpreter somewhere else.

252
00:14:26,983 --> 00:14:31,271
第二，它自己的 site-packages 目录，uv 刚建好时是空的
Second, its own site-packages folder, empty when uv makes it.

253
00:14:31,591 --> 00:14:36,988
一般叫 site-packages；Debian 把系统的叫 dist-packages
Site-packages is the usual name; Debian calls its system ones dist-packages.

254
00:14:37,308 --> 00:14:41,255
这个项目的包就装在这里，而且只装这个项目的
This is where this project's packages go, and only this project's.

255
00:14:41,500 --> 00:14:45,127
第三，一个小配置文件：pyvenv.cfg
Third, a small config file, pyvenv.cfg.

256
00:14:45,447 --> 00:14:49,393
Python 从 venv 的 bin 目录启动时，会读这个文件
When Python starts from the venv's bin folder, it reads this file.

257
00:14:49,713 --> 00:14:54,556
它说：你在 venv 里，所以用我的 site-packages，系统的不算
It says: you're in a venv, so use my site-packages, and leave the system's out.

258
00:14:54,800 --> 00:14:56,613
看看架子上的区别
Here's the difference on the shelves.

259
00:14:56,933 --> 00:15:00,069
从 venv 启动的 Python，建出的列表不一样
Started from the venv, Python builds a different list.

260
00:15:00,389 --> 00:15:04,699
标准库还是来自它软链接指向的那个真正的解释器
The standard library still comes from the real interpreter it links to.

261
00:15:05,019 --> 00:15:08,301
但系统的两层 dist-packages 架子都没了
But both dist-packages shelves from the system are gone,

262
00:15:08,301 --> 00:15:10,821
换成 venv 自己的那层
and the venv's own shelf takes their place.

263
00:15:11,066 --> 00:15:13,114
引擎还是那个引擎，工具箱换了一个
Same engine, different toolbox.

264
00:15:13,434 --> 00:15:15,243
而且两个工具箱互不相干
And the toolboxes don't mix:

265
00:15:15,243 --> 00:15:20,474
venv 里的包，系统 Python 看不见，反过来也一样
packages in the venv are invisible to the system Python, and the other way round.

266
00:15:20,716 --> 00:15:22,287
还记得 pip 的提示吗？
Remember pip's hint?

267
00:15:22,337 --> 00:15:26,711
它建议用 python3 -m venv，这是建 venv 的经典做法
It suggested python3 -m venv, the classic way to make one.

268
00:15:27,031 --> 00:15:29,975
今天用 uv 来建，它还能做更多
Today, uv makes it for us, and does a lot more.

269
00:15:30,216 --> 00:15:36,637
有些东西 venv 隔离不了：操作系统、用 C 写的系统库，还有驱动
What a venv doesn't isolate: the operating system, system libraries written in C, and drivers.

270
00:15:36,957 --> 00:15:40,229
这些要交给一整台机器，比如我们的 VM
Those are jobs for a whole machine, like our VM,

271
00:15:40,229 --> 00:15:42,206
或者交给容器，下节课再讲
or a container, next lecture.

272
00:15:42,450 --> 00:15:46,930
跑完 uv sync，我们打开真正的目录，找齐这三个部分
After uv sync, we'll open the real folder and find all three parts.

273
00:15:48,767 --> 00:15:53,610
第二部分换一台全新的 VM，设置不变，计价器又开始跳了
Part 2 starts on a fresh VM, same settings, and the meter runs again.

274
00:15:53,930 --> 00:15:57,108
全新很重要：pip 从来没碰过这个系统 Python
Fresh matters: this system Python never sees pip.

275
00:15:57,428 --> 00:15:58,993
建好后 SSH 进去
Create it and SSH in;

276
00:15:58,993 --> 00:16:04,511
名称被占用的话，说明旧 VM 还在删除，等一分钟就好
if the name is taken, the old VM is still being deleted, so wait a minute.

277
00:16:04,831 --> 00:16:07,050
暂停视频，等你的终端打开
Pause until your terminal is open.

278
00:16:07,300 --> 00:16:12,377
接着还是那四条：apt-get update、装 git、clone 和 cd
Then the same four commands: apt-get update, install git, clone, and cd.

279
00:16:12,697 --> 00:16:15,620
暂停视频，直到提示符以 simple-translate 结尾
Pause until your prompt ends in simple-translate.

280
00:16:15,884 --> 00:16:18,551
第 7 步一行命令就能装好 uv
Step 7 installs uv in one line.

281
00:16:18,871 --> 00:16:21,081
先用 curl 下载一个脚本
First, curl downloads a script:

282
00:16:21,081 --> 00:16:24,716
它会跟随重定向，安静运行但仍然显示错误
it follows redirects, stays quiet but shows errors,

283
00:16:24,716 --> 00:16:29,921
遇到 HTTP 错误就直接失败，而不是把错误页面交给 shell
and fails on an HTTP error instead of handing an error page to the shell.

284
00:16:30,184 --> 00:16:34,654
这根竖线是管道：它把脚本直接交给 shell
The vertical bar is a pipe: it hands the script straight to the shell,

285
00:16:34,654 --> 00:16:38,869
所以你运行的是网上来的代码，也就是 uv 的官方安装脚本
so you're running code from the internet: uv's official installer,

286
00:16:38,869 --> 00:16:40,469
你可以先读一遍
which you can read first.

287
00:16:40,717 --> 00:16:42,139
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

288
00:16:42,189 --> 00:16:47,748
它会装上 uv，录制时的版本是 0.13.0，还有 uvx
It installs uv, version 0.13.0 at the time of recording,

289
00:16:47,748 --> 00:16:52,216
都装到你 home 目录下的 .local/bin 里
and uvx, into .local/bin in your home folder.

290
00:16:52,467 --> 00:16:54,835
试一下 uv，这是个额外检查
Let's try uv, with an extra check.

291
00:16:55,155 --> 00:16:56,662
报 command not found
Command not found.

292
00:16:56,712 --> 00:16:58,312
可我们明明刚装好
But we just installed it.

293
00:16:58,550 --> 00:17:02,821
你输入一个命令，shell 就去一个叫 PATH 的目录列表里
When you type a command, the shell walks a list of folders called PATH,

294
00:17:02,821 --> 00:17:05,227
从左到右找，运行第一个匹配的
left to right, and runs the first match.

295
00:17:05,547 --> 00:17:09,921
哪个目录都没有 uv，而 shell 只认它启动时的 PATH
None contains uv, and the shell only knows the PATH it started with.

296
00:17:10,184 --> 00:17:13,881
安装脚本最后几行和第 8 步给了两个办法
The installer's last lines, and step 8, give two options:

297
00:17:13,881 --> 00:17:16,605
重新加载 shell，或者 source env 文件
reload your shell, or source the env file.

298
00:17:16,925 --> 00:17:20,991
重新加载就是新开一个 SSH 窗口，回到 home 目录
A reload means a new SSH window, back in your home folder,

299
00:17:20,991 --> 00:17:23,795
所以要重新 cd 进 simple-translate
so you'd cd into simple-translate again.

300
00:17:24,115 --> 00:17:27,592
用 source 更快：它把那个目录放到 PATH 最前面
Sourcing is quicker: it puts that folder first in PATH.

301
00:17:27,912 --> 00:17:29,845
暂停一下，跑一遍 source 那条命令
Pause and run the source line.

302
00:17:30,050 --> 00:17:35,917
再做两个额外检查：uv 能报出版本，which uv 也指向那个目录
Then two extra checks: uv reports its version, and which uv points into that folder.

303
00:17:36,184 --> 00:17:37,933
为什么用 source，不用 sh？
Why source, and not sh?

304
00:17:38,253 --> 00:17:41,951
直接用 sh，改的是马上就退出的子 shell
Plain sh would change a child shell that exits at once;

305
00:17:41,951 --> 00:17:43,565
source 改的是当前这个 shell
source changes this one.

306
00:17:43,885 --> 00:17:48,051
安装脚本还让你的启动文件运行这个 env 文件
The installer also made your startup files run this env file,

307
00:17:48,051 --> 00:17:51,330
所以下次连上来，直接就能找到 uv
so next time you connect, uv is found by itself.

308
00:17:51,584 --> 00:17:53,113
那 uv 到底是什么？
So what is uv?

309
00:17:53,163 --> 00:17:57,082
一个很快的工具，顶替好几个：venv 模块和 pip
One fast tool that replaces several: the venv module,

310
00:17:57,082 --> 00:18:02,037
锁版本的 pip-tools，装 Python 的 pyenv，还有 pipx
pip, pip-tools for locking, pyenv for installing Pythons, and pipx.

311
00:18:03,483 --> 00:18:04,983
第 9 步是 uv sync
Step 9 is uv sync,

312
00:18:04,983 --> 00:18:09,200
它会读 pyproject.toml，所以我们先来读一下
and it reads pyproject.toml, so let's read it first.

313
00:18:09,520 --> 00:18:10,878
项目名是 app
The name is app.

314
00:18:10,928 --> 00:18:18,480
两个依赖：art，6.5 及以上；googletrans，正好是 4.0.2
Two dependencies: art, version 6.5 or newer, and googletrans, exactly 4.0.2.

315
00:18:18,800 --> 00:18:22,470
大于等于表示一个范围；双等号表示一个确定的版本
Greater-or-equal means a range; double equals, one version.

316
00:18:22,790 --> 00:18:26,950
第 6 行又是一个范围：Python 3.13 及以上
Line 6 is a range again: Python 3.13 or newer.

317
00:18:27,200 --> 00:18:28,515
先预测一下
Now predict.

318
00:18:28,565 --> 00:18:31,040
这台 VM 上是 Python 3.11
This VM has Python 3.11.

319
00:18:31,360 --> 00:18:34,219
项目要求 3.13 及以上
The project asks for 3.13 or newer.

320
00:18:34,539 --> 00:18:36,139
那 uv sync 会怎么做？
What will uv sync do?

321
00:18:36,352 --> 00:18:39,786
直接失败，照样用 3.11，还是做点别的？
Fail, use 3.11 anyway, or something else?

322
00:18:48,633 --> 00:18:50,340
暂停一下，跑一遍 uv sync
Pause and run uv sync.

323
00:18:50,660 --> 00:18:54,906
它没有失败，而是下载了 uv 自己的 Python
Instead of failing, uv downloads its own Python:

324
00:18:54,906 --> 00:18:58,532
CPython 3.15.0，这是录制时的版本
CPython 3.15.0, at the time of recording.

325
00:18:58,852 --> 00:19:02,116
然后它在 .venv 里建了一个虚拟环境
Then it creates a virtual environment in .venv.

326
00:19:02,436 --> 00:19:08,046
如果 uv 找不到 pyproject.toml，先 cd 进 simple-translate
If uv can't find a pyproject.toml, cd into simple-translate first.

327
00:19:08,283 --> 00:19:09,790
来看看刚才发生了什么
Here's what happened.

328
00:19:09,840 --> 00:19:12,379
把 Python 的各个版本画在一条数轴上
Picture Python versions on a number line.

329
00:19:12,699 --> 00:19:16,582
这个约束点亮了从 3.13 往后的所有版本
The constraint lights up everything from 3.13 onward.

330
00:19:16,902 --> 00:19:22,427
首先，uv 会找它已经有的解释器：先找自己下载过的，再找系统的
First, uv looks for an interpreter it already has: its own downloads, then the system's.

331
00:19:22,747 --> 00:19:27,824
Debian 的 3.11.2 落在范围外面，所以用不了
Debian's 3.11.2 lands outside the range, so it can't be used.

332
00:19:28,066 --> 00:19:30,946
所以 uv 要下载一个。下载哪一个呢？
So uv downloads one. Which one?

333
00:19:31,266 --> 00:19:38,647
不是 3.13，而是范围内最新的版本，我们录制时是 3.15.0
Not 3.13, but the newest release in the range, which was 3.15.0 when we recorded.

334
00:19:38,967 --> 00:19:41,475
它装在你 home 目录下 uv 自己的目录里
It lives in uv's own folder in your home,

335
00:19:41,475 --> 00:19:43,554
venv 的 python 就软链接到它
and the venv's python links to it.

336
00:19:43,800 --> 00:19:46,488
问题就在这儿：约束不是 pin
That's the catch: a constraint is not a pin.

337
00:19:46,808 --> 00:19:52,419
在 Python 3.15 出来之前，同样这条命令装的是 3.14
Before Python 3.15 came out, this same command gave people 3.14.

338
00:19:52,739 --> 00:19:56,386
明年再看这个视频的话，你拿到的可能是更新的版本
Watch this video next year, and you may get something newer still.

339
00:19:56,633 --> 00:19:59,321
到了 Debian 13，情况就不一样了
On Debian 13, the story changes.

340
00:19:59,641 --> 00:20:04,718
它的系统 Python 是 3.13.5，本来就在范围里
Its system Python, 3.13.5, is already inside the range.

341
00:20:05,038 --> 00:20:07,652
所以 uv 直接用它，不用下载
So uv simply uses it, with no download,

342
00:20:07,652 --> 00:20:10,734
venv 的 python 就软链接到系统的那个
and the venv's python links to the system one.

343
00:20:11,054 --> 00:20:14,041
同一条命令，不同的 Debian，不同的 Python
Same command, different Debian, different Python.

344
00:20:14,283 --> 00:20:16,822
想在哪儿都用同一个 Python，就把它 pin 住
To get the same Python everywhere, pin it.

345
00:20:17,142 --> 00:20:21,337
这条命令是 uv python pin 3.13，README 里没有
The command uv python pin 3.13, not in the README,

346
00:20:21,337 --> 00:20:24,945
它会写一个小文件，叫 .python-version
writes a small file called .python-version,

347
00:20:24,945 --> 00:20:28,384
范围就缩小到 3.13 系列
and the range shrinks to the 3.13 series.

348
00:20:28,704 --> 00:20:32,116
现在先别跑：下次 uv sync 会重建 venv
Don't run it now: your next uv sync would rebuild the venv,

349
00:20:32,116 --> 00:20:34,486
视频后面的内容就对不上了
and the rest of the video wouldn't match.

350
00:20:34,806 --> 00:20:36,406
这个放在练习里了
It's in the exercises.

351
00:20:37,650 --> 00:20:39,243
接下来看包
Now the packages.

352
00:20:39,293 --> 00:20:43,295
先出个小题：pyproject.toml 列了 2 个依赖
A quick puzzle: pyproject.toml lists 2 dependencies,

353
00:20:43,295 --> 00:20:47,143
第一部分里，pip 为它们装了 12 个包
and in part 1, pip installed 12 packages for them.

354
00:20:47,463 --> 00:20:49,127
那 uv 会装几个？
How many will uv install?

355
00:20:55,967 --> 00:20:58,420
是 11 个：比第一部分少一个
It's 11: one fewer than part 1.

356
00:20:58,740 --> 00:21:04,372
解析了 13 个，装了 11 个，每个都带一个加号和精确版本
It resolved 13 and installed 11, each with a plus sign and an exact version.

357
00:21:04,692 --> 00:21:08,020
另外 9 个从哪儿来，少的又是哪一个？
So where did the other 9 come from, and which one went missing?

358
00:21:08,267 --> 00:21:13,899
包自己也有依赖；这条额外的命令，uv tree，会把它们画出来
Packages have dependencies of their own; this extra command, uv tree, draws them.

359
00:21:14,219 --> 00:21:18,709
我们的 googletrans 需要 httpx，一个 HTTP 库
Our googletrans needs httpx, an HTTP library,

360
00:21:18,709 --> 00:21:23,798
它又需要 anyio、certifi、httpcore、h2，还有更多
which needs anyio, certifi, httpcore, h2, and more.

361
00:21:24,118 --> 00:21:25,973
两个愿望，长成了一棵树
Two wishes grow into a tree.

362
00:21:26,217 --> 00:21:30,769
所谓解析，就是给依赖树里的每个包选定一个精确版本
Resolving means choosing one exact version for every package in the tree,

363
00:21:30,769 --> 00:21:32,702
而且这些版本要彼此兼容
versions that all fit together.

364
00:21:33,022 --> 00:21:39,102
然后 uv 把它们写进一个新文件 uv.lock，连同下载地址和校验和
Then uv writes them to a new file, uv.lock, with download addresses and checksums.

365
00:21:39,422 --> 00:21:42,537
这个 pyproject.toml 文件是你的愿望清单
The pyproject.toml file is your wish list.

366
00:21:42,857 --> 00:21:45,331
而 uv.lock 文件是购物小票
The uv.lock file is the receipt.

367
00:21:45,567 --> 00:21:47,380
那为什么解析了 13 个？
So why 13 resolved?

368
00:21:47,700 --> 00:21:52,159
是 11 个包，加上这个应用本身，uv 不用下载它
It's 11 packages, plus the app itself, which uv doesn't download.

369
00:21:52,479 --> 00:21:54,312
第 13 个在 uv.lock 里
The 13th is in uv.lock,

370
00:21:54,312 --> 00:21:59,092
它覆盖了项目允许的每一个 Python，不只是我们这个
which covers every Python the project allows, not just ours.

371
00:21:59,412 --> 00:22:02,569
文件里写着，anyio 需要 typing-extensions
In it, anyio needs typing-extensions,

372
00:22:02,569 --> 00:22:05,556
但只在低于 3.15 的 Python 上
but only on Python older than 3.15.

373
00:22:05,800 --> 00:22:08,872
在我们的 3.15 上跳过了，所以是 11 个
On our 3.15, it's skipped, so 11.

374
00:22:09,192 --> 00:22:13,843
第一部分是 Python 3.11，所以 pip 装了它：12 个
Part 1 ran on Python 3.11, so pip installed it: 12.

375
00:22:14,163 --> 00:22:19,603
而 Debian 13 用的是 Python 3.13，uv 也装了 12 个
And on Debian 13, with Python 3.13, uv installs 12 too.

376
00:22:19,850 --> 00:22:21,621
再说说小票为什么重要
Here's why the receipt matters.

377
00:22:21,941 --> 00:22:24,629
两个同学隔一周各跑一次 uv sync
Two students run uv sync a week apart.

378
00:22:24,949 --> 00:22:30,090
没有共用的 lock 文件，各自从头解析，树的深处就可能版本不同
Without a shared lock, each resolves fresh and may get different versions deep in the tree.

379
00:22:30,410 --> 00:22:34,613
有了同一个 uv.lock，他们拿到的包就完全一样
With the same uv.lock, they get exactly the same packages.

380
00:22:34,850 --> 00:22:36,443
两个额外检查
Two extra checks.

381
00:22:36,493 --> 00:22:42,125
第一，ls -a 显示多了两样东西：.venv 目录和 uv.lock
First, ls -a shows two new things: the .venv folder, and uv.lock.

382
00:22:42,445 --> 00:22:45,581
而 git status 说，uv.lock 还没被跟踪
And git status says uv.lock is untracked.

383
00:22:45,901 --> 00:22:48,525
它是这里生成的，不是 repo 自带的
It was made here; it didn't come with the repo.

384
00:22:48,767 --> 00:22:52,159
这里 README 有一个小错误，改起来很简单
Now, a small mistake in the README, with an easy fix.

385
00:22:52,479 --> 00:22:56,426
它说 uv.lock 能让下一个人拿到相同的版本
It says uv.lock gives the next person the same versions.

386
00:22:56,746 --> 00:22:58,711
但这个 repo 从没 commit 过它
But the repo never committed one,

387
00:22:58,711 --> 00:23:01,332
所以大家第一次 sync 都是从头解析
so each student's first sync resolves fresh.

388
00:23:01,652 --> 00:23:04,532
自己的项目里，记得 commit uv.lock
In your own projects, commit uv.lock.

389
00:23:04,852 --> 00:23:08,868
自动化构建里，给 uv sync 加上 --locked 参数
In automated builds, run uv sync with the --locked flag,

390
00:23:08,868 --> 00:23:11,593
lock 文件缺失或过期就拒绝执行
which refuses a missing or stale lock.

391
00:23:11,833 --> 00:23:14,564
最后再加一个额外步骤：重新跑一遍 uv sync
Last, an extra: run uv sync again.

392
00:23:14,884 --> 00:23:17,455
它检查同样的包，这里是 11 个
It checks the same packages, 11 here,

393
00:23:17,455 --> 00:23:22,735
用时不到一毫秒，什么都不改：随时重跑都没问题
in a fraction of a millisecond, and changes nothing: safe to re-run anytime.

394
00:23:23,983 --> 00:23:26,138
按之前说的，打开 venv 看看
Let's open the venv, as promised.

395
00:23:26,458 --> 00:23:29,325
这条额外命令列出 bin 目录
This extra command lists its bin folder:

396
00:23:29,325 --> 00:23:32,406
python 软链接到 uv 下载的 Python
python, a link to the Python uv downloaded,

397
00:23:32,406 --> 00:23:34,006
注意，没有 pip
and, notice, no pip.

398
00:23:34,783 --> 00:23:38,853
还有配置文件：home 是真正解释器的目录
And the config file: home is the real interpreter's folder,

399
00:23:38,853 --> 00:23:43,060
include-system-site-packages 是 false，prompt 是 app
include-system-site-packages is false, and the prompt is app.

400
00:23:43,380 --> 00:23:45,194
三个部分，和画的一样
All three parts, as drawn.

401
00:23:45,433 --> 00:23:49,102
第 10 步：source .venv/bin/activate
Step 10: source .venv/bin/activate.

402
00:23:49,422 --> 00:23:50,844
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

403
00:23:50,894 --> 00:23:53,774
提示符现在以 app 开头，外面带括号
Your prompt now starts with app, in parentheses.

404
00:23:54,094 --> 00:23:56,612
README 的例子写的是 simple-translate
The README's example says simple-translate.

405
00:23:56,932 --> 00:24:02,244
但 uv 用项目名做提示符，pyproject.toml 里项目名是 app
But uv names the prompt after the project, and pyproject.toml calls it app.

406
00:24:02,483 --> 00:24:03,734
变了什么？
What changed?

407
00:24:03,784 --> 00:24:08,243
激活之前，python 敲遍了 PATH 里的每扇门，什么也没找到
Before activating, python knocked on every door in PATH and found nothing.

408
00:24:08,563 --> 00:24:11,173
这个 activate 脚本先存下旧的 PATH
The activate script saves your old PATH,

409
00:24:11,173 --> 00:24:13,978
再把 venv 的 bin 目录排到最前
then puts the bin folder of the venv first,

410
00:24:13,978 --> 00:24:16,392
这样在第一扇门就能找到 python
so python is found at the first door.

411
00:24:16,633 --> 00:24:21,181
额外检查一下：which python 指向 .venv 里面
Extra checks: which python points into .venv,

412
00:24:21,181 --> 00:24:26,436
python 报出的版本是 3.15.0，这是录制时的
and python reports 3.15.0, at the time of recording;

413
00:24:26,436 --> 00:24:28,558
在 Debian 13 上是 3.13.5
on Debian 13, 3.13.5.

414
00:24:28,878 --> 00:24:30,521
而 which pip 什么也没找到
And which pip finds nothing.

415
00:24:31,416 --> 00:24:37,154
README 还有一个小错误：它说激活后 pip 会指向 venv
Another small mistake in the README: it says activation points pip into the venv,

416
00:24:37,154 --> 00:24:38,925
但 uv 建的 venv 根本没有 pip
but a uv venv has no pip.

417
00:24:39,245 --> 00:24:43,362
如果机器上有系统 pip，which pip 找到的就是它
On a machine with a system pip, which pip finds that one instead,

418
00:24:43,362 --> 00:24:45,389
而它会拒绝安装，和一开始一样
and it refuses, as at the start.

419
00:24:45,709 --> 00:24:48,284
要添加包，用 uv add
To add a package, use uv add,

420
00:24:48,284 --> 00:24:52,899
它还会把包记进 pyproject.toml 和 uv.lock
which also records it in pyproject.toml and uv.lock.

421
00:24:53,133 --> 00:24:56,526
激活还会设置一个叫 VIRTUAL_ENV 的环境变量
Activation also sets a variable called VIRTUAL_ENV,

422
00:24:56,526 --> 00:25:01,581
改提示符，再加一个 deactivate 命令，撤销这一切
changes the prompt, and adds a command called deactivate that undoes it all.

423
00:25:01,901 --> 00:25:05,634
它只改变 shell 先去哪儿找，而且只在当前 shell 里有效
It only changes where the shell looks first, and only in this shell.

424
00:25:05,954 --> 00:25:08,195
要是 SSH 窗口重连了
If your SSH window reconnects,

425
00:25:08,195 --> 00:25:11,480
就再 cd 进 simple-translate，重新激活
cd into simple-translate and activate again.

426
00:25:11,766 --> 00:25:15,542
第 11 步：同样跑三次，这次用不带 3 的 python
Step 11: the same three runs, now with plain python.

427
00:25:15,862 --> 00:25:20,875
长的两条从 README 复制，连引号一起，暂停一下，三条都跑一遍
Copy the long ones from the README, quotes included, and pause to run all three.

428
00:25:21,195 --> 00:25:24,715
这次 Google 正常回应了：这些是真实的译文
This time Google answered: these are real translations.

429
00:25:25,035 --> 00:25:30,028
如果又碰到 429，但看得到 Input 那一行，你的 venv 就没问题
If you get a 429 again but see the Input line, your venv works.

430
00:25:30,266 --> 00:25:33,594
两个不用激活的额外办法，README 里都没有
Two extras, not in the README, that skip activation.

431
00:25:33,914 --> 00:25:38,325
第一，uv run python cli.py
First, uv run python cli.py syncs the venv if needed,

432
00:25:38,325 --> 00:25:40,655
需要时先同步 venv，再在里面运行应用
then runs the app inside it.

433
00:25:40,975 --> 00:25:43,152
或者用路径调用 venv 的 python
Or call the venv's python by its path.

434
00:25:43,400 --> 00:25:46,387
为什么要 source，而不直接运行 activate 脚本？
And why source, not just run the activate script?

435
00:25:46,707 --> 00:25:48,374
它根本不可执行
It isn't even executable,

436
00:25:48,374 --> 00:25:53,142
就算当程序运行，也只改一个马上退出的子 shell
and run as a program, it would only change a child shell that exits at once,

437
00:25:53,142 --> 00:25:54,742
跟 env 文件一样
like the env file.

438
00:25:55,883 --> 00:25:58,507
我们用几个额外命令来验证隔离
Let's prove the isolation with a few extras.

439
00:25:58,827 --> 00:26:03,798
先 deactivate：venv 激活的时候，连 python3 都指向它
Deactivate first: while the venv is active, even python3 points into it.

440
00:26:04,118 --> 00:26:07,872
再让系统的 python3 去 import googletrans
Then ask the system's python3 to import googletrans.

441
00:26:08,192 --> 00:26:09,792
报 ModuleNotFoundError
ModuleNotFoundError.

442
00:26:10,112 --> 00:26:13,483
在这台 VM 上，包只在 venv 里
On this VM, the packages exist only in the venv.

443
00:26:13,716 --> 00:26:18,175
在架子上看：系统 Python 从上到下扫一遍自己的列表
On the shelves: the system Python scans its own list, top to bottom.

444
00:26:18,495 --> 00:26:22,292
而 venv 的架子不在这个列表上，所以搜了个空
The venv's shelf isn't on that list, so the search comes up empty.

445
00:26:22,616 --> 00:26:24,693
现在用 uv run 做同样的 import
Now the same import through uv run,

446
00:26:24,693 --> 00:26:27,245
顺便打印这个 Python 认为自己在哪儿
printing where this Python thinks it lives.

447
00:26:27,565 --> 00:26:30,360
能导入，打印的正是 .venv 目录
It works, and the answer is our .venv folder.

448
00:26:30,600 --> 00:26:33,245
现在假设你还留着第一部分的 VM
Now imagine you'd kept your part-1 VM.

449
00:26:33,565 --> 00:26:37,682
同样 import，系统 python3，没有 venv。能导入吗？
Same import, system python3, no venv. Does it work?

450
00:26:44,516 --> 00:26:47,594
能：那台 VM 上，sudo pip 装的 googletrans
Yes: on that VM, sudo pip put googletrans

451
00:26:47,594 --> 00:26:52,324
在系统级的 /usr/local 架子上，每个程序都找得到
on the system-wide /usr/local shelf, so every program finds it.

452
00:26:52,644 --> 00:26:55,460
同一个 import，架子不同，答案不同
Same import, different shelves, different answer.

453
00:26:55,700 --> 00:26:57,449
反过来也成立
And it works the other way too.

454
00:26:57,769 --> 00:26:59,765
哪怕在第一部分那台乱糟糟的 VM 上
Even on that messy part-1 VM,

455
00:26:59,765 --> 00:27:03,205
venv 也会无视 sudo pip 装的一切
a venv would ignore everything sudo pip put there,

456
00:27:03,205 --> 00:27:06,025
因为那些架子不在它的列表上
because those shelves aren't on its list.

457
00:27:06,345 --> 00:27:08,521
整节课的要点，就在这一张图里
That's the whole lesson in one picture.

458
00:27:10,167 --> 00:27:14,668
还有一个你会碰到的工具：pipenv，做同一件事的老办法
One more tool you'll meet: pipenv, an older way to do the same job.

459
00:27:14,988 --> 00:27:16,781
这个 repo 的 pipenv 分支
This repo's pipenv branch,

460
00:27:16,781 --> 00:27:19,746
也就是这个教程的旧版本，用的就是它
an older version of this tutorial, uses it.

461
00:27:20,066 --> 00:27:21,532
单独的 AWS 版本
So do the separate

462
00:27:21,532 --> 00:27:25,570
还有后面 cheese app 的 API 服务，也都用它
AWS version and, later, the cheese app's API service.

463
00:27:25,817 --> 00:27:27,737
思路一样，名字不同
Same ideas, different names.

464
00:27:28,057 --> 00:27:31,860
这个 pyproject.toml 换成 Pipfile
The pyproject.toml file becomes the Pipfile,

465
00:27:31,860 --> 00:27:34,713
uv.lock 换成 Pipfile.lock
and uv.lock becomes Pipfile.lock.

466
00:27:35,033 --> 00:27:39,044
venv 放在你 home 目录下的某个目录里，而不是项目里
The venv lives in a folder in your home instead of in the project.

467
00:27:39,364 --> 00:27:43,652
命令 uv sync，换成 pipenv install 或 pipenv sync
The command uv sync becomes pipenv install, or pipenv sync.

468
00:27:43,972 --> 00:27:48,644
而激活换成了 pipenv shell：在 venv 里开一个新的 shell
And instead of activating, pipenv shell opens a new shell inside the venv.

469
00:27:48,964 --> 00:27:50,564
输入 exit 就能退出
Type exit to leave it.

470
00:27:50,717 --> 00:27:52,978
我们那个问题又来了，这次是真的
And here's our puzzle again, for real.

471
00:27:53,298 --> 00:27:57,821
那个分支的 lock 文件锁定的是 httpx 0.13.3
That branch's lock file pins httpx 0.13.3,

472
00:27:57,821 --> 00:28:04,392
而我们的 uv sync 装的是 0.28.1，这是录制时的版本
while our uv sync installed 0.28.1, at the time of recording.

473
00:28:04,712 --> 00:28:08,637
同一个应用的两个版本，两个版本的 httpx
Two versions of the same app, two versions of httpx.

474
00:28:08,957 --> 00:28:12,221
在一个公用的系统 Python 里，它们没法共存
On one shared system Python, they couldn't live together.

475
00:28:12,541 --> 00:28:14,141
放在两个 venv 里，就可以
In two venvs, they can.

476
00:28:17,050 --> 00:28:20,265
第 12 步：把 VM 连同启动磁盘一起删掉
Step 12: delete the VM, with its boot disk,

477
00:28:20,265 --> 00:28:24,303
再确认 VM instances 和 Disks 页面都是空的
then check that VM instances and Disks are both empty.

478
00:28:24,623 --> 00:28:27,034
现在就暂停去删，免得忘了
Pause and do it now, before you forget.

479
00:28:27,283 --> 00:28:28,790
我们小结一下
Here's where we are.

480
00:28:28,840 --> 00:28:32,744
这台 VM 给了我们一整台机器，能随便折腾，用完就删
The VM gave us a whole machine that we can wreck and delete.

481
00:28:33,064 --> 00:28:37,139
而 venv 把一个项目的包，和这台机器的 Python 隔开
The venv keeps one project's packages away from that machine's Python.

482
00:28:37,459 --> 00:28:40,361
在这两者之间，还能再加一层
And between the two, there's room for one more layer.

483
00:28:40,600 --> 00:28:43,523
这一层就是容器，下节课讲
That layer is a container, and it's next lecture.

484
00:28:43,843 --> 00:28:47,293
教程里的 Dockerfile 已经体现了这个思路
The tutorial's Dockerfile already shows the idea:

485
00:28:47,293 --> 00:28:49,827
复制代码，跑同样的 uv sync
copy the code, run the same uv sync,

486
00:28:49,827 --> 00:28:52,995
然后在激活了 venv 的 shell 里启动
and start in a shell with the venv activated.

487
00:28:53,315 --> 00:28:56,067
今天做的一切，都打包进一个镜像
Everything you did today, baked into an image.

488
00:28:56,317 --> 00:28:58,280
下节课有一件事要留意
One thing to watch for next time.

489
00:28:58,600 --> 00:29:02,405
这个 Dockerfile 用的是 Python 3.12 的镜像
The Dockerfile starts from a Python 3.12 image,

490
00:29:02,405 --> 00:29:05,320
但项目要求 3.13 及以上
but the project wants 3.13 or newer.

491
00:29:05,640 --> 00:29:08,135
uv 会怎么处理，你已经知道了
You already know what uv will do about that.

492
00:29:08,383 --> 00:29:11,412
最后，留五道题给你自测
Before you go, five questions to test yourself.

493
00:29:11,732 --> 00:29:14,681
第一题：--break-system-packages 这个参数
One: what does the --break-system-packages flag

494
00:29:14,681 --> 00:29:18,069
到底破坏了什么，sudo pip3 把文件放到了哪儿？
actually break, and where did sudo pip3 put the files?

495
00:29:18,317 --> 00:29:21,368
第二题：说出虚拟环境的三个部分
Two: name the three parts of a virtual environment.

496
00:29:21,688 --> 00:29:24,278
第三题：激活到底改了什么
Three: what exactly does activation change,

497
00:29:24,278 --> 00:29:27,170
不激活的话，有哪两种办法运行这个应用？
and what are two ways to run the app without it?

498
00:29:27,417 --> 00:29:30,617
第四题：2 个依赖变成了 11 个包
Four: 2 dependencies became 11 packages.

499
00:29:30,937 --> 00:29:33,966
为什么会这样，哪个文件让每个人拿到同样的包？
Why, and which file makes everyone get the same ones?

500
00:29:34,286 --> 00:29:37,694
第五题：要求 Python 3.13 及以上
Five: is requires Python 3.13 or newer a pin,

501
00:29:37,694 --> 00:29:41,177
算不算 pin，怎样才能让版本确定下来？
and what would make the version deterministic?

502
00:29:41,417 --> 00:29:43,593
答案在练习里
The answers are in the exercises.

503
00:29:43,913 --> 00:29:47,043
今天的每条命令都在学习指南里
Every command from today is in the study guide,

504
00:29:47,043 --> 00:29:48,841
在 MLOps Learning 这个 repo 里
in the MLOps Learning repo.

505
00:29:49,161 --> 00:29:50,867
下节课：容器
Next time: containers.
